OL,3,GNEWSAOne-hour parking limit sparks
OL,4,Ashopping fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA haircut, a coffee, a chat with
OL,7,Ffriends, a visit to the butcher and a
OL,8,Fquick grocery shop.
OL,10,FFor many people, that is what a trip to
OL,11,Fa local shopping precinct looks like.
OL,13,FBut at Weeping Cross, on the outskirts
OL,14,Fof Stafford, traders and shoppers fear
OL,15,Fa new 60-minute parking limit could
OL,16,Fchange those routines.
OL,18,FThe restriction is being introduced at
OL,19,Fa car park owned by the Central Co-op,
OL,20,Fwhich says spaces have too often been
OL,21,Foccupied by people who are not using
OL,22,Fits store.
